        8     field to-sel as logical
        9     field price-rubl as decimal
       10     index art  is primary unique artic prod-type prod-code
       11     index code is         unique gds-code
       12     index oi order-num
       13     index isel to-sel
       14   .
       15   define input  parameter p-doc-code    as character                        no-undo .
       16   define input  parameter p-is-edo      as logical                          no-undo .
       17   define output parameter p-rid-list    as character                        no-undo .
